	<Table Name="Standard" Type="BuildingBuildList">
		<!-- Stages 1/2 require 1/2 owned bases; stage 3 counts are PER OWNED BASE, scaled by the Standard trigger. Main: 2 pads + depot + 2 reactors + barracks + air = 7 sockets. Two bases: 5 pads + 3 depots + 2 reactors + barracks + 2 air + armory = 14. No base bids here. Forge's pad transforms to supplypad_02 and his air pad to airpadSerina_01; both are counted by family/variant triggers. -->
